B.aPv=new A.a8("What is worrying me most right now, and is it within my control?","Separate what you can act on from what you cannot. Control is a powerful antidote to anxiety.")
B.aNU=new A.a8("Describe the last time I felt calm. What was different?","Identifying your calm conditions helps you recreate them intentionally.")
B.aOd=new A.a8("What is the worst realistic outcome I am afraid of \u2014 and could I survive it?","Naming the fear at full size often shrinks it. You have survived hard things before.")
B.aOA=new A.a8("Write a letter to my anxious self from three months in the future.","Your future self already got through this. What would they tell you today?")
B.aNK=new A.a8("What are 3 things I know to be true right now, in this moment?","Grounding in facts anchors an anxious mind back to the present.")
B.aon=s([B.aPv,B.aNU,B.aOd,B.aOA,B.aNK],t.L)
B.aQ7=new A.a8("What was one moment today that felt even slightly less heavy?","Even a flicker of lightness counts. Train your mind to notice it.")
B.aQ_=new A.a8('What would "taking care of myself today" look like \u2014 even in a tiny way?',"Self-care during depression is not luxury. It is medicine.")
B.aOI=new A.a8("Write about a person who believes in you. What would they say right now?","Sometimes we need to borrow someone else's belief in us.")
B.aPC=new A.a8("What am I carrying that I have not let myself grieve?","Unexpressed grief often sits at the root of low mood. Naming it is healing.")
B.aOg=new A.a8("If my mood were a weather pattern, what would it be today \u2014 and what caused it?","Externalising mood as weather makes it feel less personal and more temporary.")
B.akR=s([B.aQ7,B.aQ_,B.aOI,B.aPC,B.aOg],t.L)
B.aPr=new A.a8("What are all the things on my mind right now? Write them all out.","A brain dump clears mental RAM. Once it's on paper, you can prioritise.")
B.aPo=new A.a8("What is the most important task this week \u2014 and what would happen if I skipped everything else?","Stress often comes from treating everything as equally urgent. It rarely is.")
B.aP1=new A.a8("When was the last time I truly rested \u2014 not scrolled, not studied, but rested?","Rest is not wasted time. It is how your brain consolidates and resets.")
B.aOz=new A.a8("What would I tell a fellow student dealing with exactly my workload right now?","We are usually kinder to others than to ourselves. Apply that kindness inward.")
B.aO7=new A.a8("Where is my stress coming from \u2014 the task itself, or what I fear it means about me?","Much stress is tied to identity. Separating performance from self-worth is liberating.")
B.ajw=s([B.aPr,B.aPo,B.aP1,B.aOz,B.aO7],t.L)
B.aQy=new A.a8("What thoughts keep visiting me when I try to sleep? Write them out now.","Getting racing thoughts out of your head and onto paper can silence them at night.")
B.aON=new A.a8("What does my bedtime routine look like \u2014 and what am I doing right up until sleep?","The last 30 minutes before bed shape sleep quality more than almost anything else.")
B.aPg=new A.a8("What worries am I carrying into bed with me? Can any wait until tomorrow?","Many concerns are best left for tomorrow. Write them here so your brain lets go.")
B.aNJ=new A.a8("How did I feel on days when I slept well? What was different the day before?","Your best sleep nights hold clues. Pattern recognition is powerful.")
B.aQk=new A.a8("What would my ideal morning feel like if I slept properly tonight?","Visualising a great morning can motivate healthier evening choices.")
B.ajD=s([B.aQy,B.aON,B.aPg,B.aNJ,B.aQk],t.L)
B.aPi=new A.a8("Describe a moment when I felt genuinely connected to someone. What made it feel safe?","Understanding what safety feels like helps you seek it and create it again.")
B.aOt=new A.a8("What am I afraid will happen if I put myself out there socially?","Name the fear specifically. Most social fears are survivable.")
B.aO3=new A.a8("Who in my life makes me feel seen without me having to perform?","Identify your anchor relationships. These are worth nurturing deeply.")
B.aNL=new A.a8("What would I say to a new person if I had zero fear of rejection?","The version of you without fear usually knows what the real you wants to say.")
B.aOr=new A.a8("How has loneliness shaped who I am \u2014 and what has it taught me?","Loneliness, while painful, often deepens our capacity for empathy and self-knowledge.")
B.app=s([B.aPi,B.aOt,B.aO3,B.aNL,B.aOr],t.L)
B.aOO=new A.a8("What would I be working toward if I knew I could not fail?","Fear of failure is often the only thing standing between you and your real goals.")
B.aQw=new A.a8("What did I do last week that I am quietly proud of?","Motivation grows from recognising progress. Look for it \u2014 even the small kind.")
B.aP2=new A.a8("What drains my motivation most, and what is one thing I can remove or reduce?","Protecting your energy is as important as generating it.")
B.aPy=new A.a8('What is my "why" behind the thing I am trying to stay motivated for?',"Surface-level motivation fades. Connecting to a deeper purpose sustains action.")
B.aQe=new A.a8("Write about a version of myself 1 year from now who stayed consistent. What does their life look like?","Your future self is built by the choices your present self makes today.")
B.apv=s([B.aOO,B.aQw,B.aP2,B.aPy,B.aQe],t.L)
B.aOT=new A.a8("Describe the last 5 minutes in sensory detail \u2014 what did I see, hear, feel?","Sensory recounting trains the brain to dwell in the present, not in past or future.")
B.aOy=new A.a8("What thoughts came and went in the last hour that I barely noticed?","Mindfulness begins with noticing. You cannot change what you cannot observe.")
B.aQu=new A.a8('When today did I feel most "in the flow" \u2014 completely absorbed?',"Flow states are naturally mindful. Understanding what triggers yours is valuable.")
B.aQa=new A.a8("What am I resisting right now \u2014 and what would happen if I simply allowed it?","Mindfulness teaches acceptance before action. Resistance consumes energy.")
B.aPx=new A.a8("Write a gratitude for something so ordinary I usually overlook it.","Attention to the small things is a mindfulness muscle. It gets stronger with practice.")
B.amF=s([B.aOT,B.aOy,B.aQu,B.aQa,B.aPx],t.L)
B.aQ1=new A.a8("Write 5 things I genuinely like about myself that have nothing to do with achievement.","Self-worth built on performance is fragile. Build it on who you are, not what you do.")
B.aOB=new A.a8("What would I never say to a friend \u2014 but say to myself regularly?","Naming your inner critic's script is the first step to rewriting it.")
B.aNW=new A.a8("When did I last stand up for myself? How did it feel?","Self-advocacy is a form of self-respect. Reflect on how it felt \u2014 even if it was hard.")
B.aQA=new A.a8("What am I more capable of than I give myself credit for?","We routinely underestimate ourselves. This prompt lets you correct the record.")
B.aNv=new A.a8("Who taught me to see myself the way I currently do \u2014 and was that accurate?","Our self-image is often inherited. Examine its origins critically.")
B.alV=s([B.aQ1,B.aOB,B.aNW,B.aQA,B.aNv],t.L)
B.aOV=new A.a8("Write freely about who or what I am grieving. No structure \u2014 just let it out.","Grief does not need to be eloquent or organised. It just needs to be expressed.")
B.aNS=new A.a8("What do I miss most, and what does that missing tell me about what I value?","Grief reveals our deepest values. What we mourn most shows what matters most.")
B.aQ4=new A.a8("What would I want to say to who or what I have lost, if I could?","Unsaid words carry weight. Writing them here \u2014 even to no one \u2014 can release that weight.")
B.aNw=new A.a8("Describe a memory that still brings both joy and sadness at the same time.","Grief and love coexist. Honoring both is not contradiction \u2014 it is wholeness.")
B.aPe=new A.a8("What parts of myself am I also grieving \u2014 old versions of who I used to be?","Sometimes the hardest grief is for who we thought we would become.")
B.apk=s([B.aOV,B.aNS,B.aQ4,B.aNw,B.aPe],t.L)
B.aO8=new A.a8("Which relationship in my life feels most draining right now, and why?","Naming what drains you is the first step to addressing or releasing it.")
B.aQh=new A.a8("What do I need most from my relationships that I have not asked for yet?","Unvoiced needs create silent resentment. Naming them here prepares you to voice them.")
B.aOL=new A.a8("How do I typically respond when someone disappoints me? Is that serving me?","Our relationship patterns are often automatic. Examining them creates choice.")
B.aPu=new A.a8("Describe a relationship dynamic I keep repeating. What is my part in it?","Patterns persist until we see our own role. This is empowering, not blaming.")
B.aPf=new A.a8("What does a healthy relationship feel like in my body \u2014 and how can I recognise it?","Our nervous system knows the difference between safe and unsafe. Learn its signals.")
B.akG=s([B.aO8,B.aQh,B.aOL,B.aPu,B.aPf],t.L)
B.N8=new A.d(B.nl,[B.aon,B.akR,B.ajw,B.ajD,B.app,B.apv,B.amF,B.alV,B.apk,B.akG],t.hb)
