s($,"cnV","bNV",()=>A.a([A.bLJ("7 in 10 Kenyan students","Most Kenyan university students silently struggle \u2014 HELB stress, CAT pressure, family expectations. MindBridge is your private space \u2014 zero stigma, total support.",B.h,"You're not\nalone.",B.bhk),A.bLJ("AI trained in CBT & DBT","Available 24/7, Maya listens without judgment and adapts to exactly how you feel \u2014 like a friend who always has time.",B.a2,"Meet Maya,\nyour AI ally.",B.bf8),A.bLJ("100% private & secure","Track moods, journal thoughts, build streaks. Beautiful insights show just how far you've come.",B.y,"Build habits\nthat stick.",B.bi7)],A.aH("O<Kc>")))
